[[- end ]]
[[- if .CRDGroup ]]
- [ ] `task schemas:vendor -- --only [[ .Name ]]` before rendering any [[ .CRDGroup ]] resource; add `helmArgs` in `tests/schemas/sources.yaml` if the chart gates its CRDs behind a value
- [ ] Check the Ready-condition health Lua fits how the operator reports status (`task test:health`)
[[- end ]]
